  "body": "Auction: on site on Tuesday 17 November 2026 at 5:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of Red Beach's most accessible and sought-after pockets, 92 Rosario Crescent offers an incredible coastal lifestyle packed with sun, space, and ultimate convenience. Sitting proudly on a generous corner site bathed in natural light, this feature-packed family home is tailored for those who love outdoor living, dual driveway access and needs room for all the beach gear.\r\n\r\nUpstairs forms the heart of the home, where sun-soaked living spaces flow seamlessly into a functional kitchen and dining area, alongside two spacious bedrooms and the main bathroom. From the kitchen and dining space, step directly out into your private outdoor oasis - an entertainer’s paradise featuring a sun-drenched swimming pool surrounded by a bright, sunny entertaining area built for summer BBQs and lounging in the sun. For year-round relaxation, you can also take full advantage of the indoor built-in spa pool no matter the season.\r\n\r\nDownstairs opens up a world of flexibility with a generous third bedroom - ideal for teenagers, guests, or a dedicated home office setup. A large workshop/storage room offers a dream space for tradespeople, hobbyists, or housing surfboards and beach gear. Outside, the dual driveway access provides expansive off-street parking for multiple vehicles, boats, or the campervan with ease.\r\n\r\nThe prime Red Beach location simply doesn’t get better than this. Take a short walk down the road to the golden sands and surf of Red Beach itself, as well as Red Beach Primary School and the local shops. You are in zone for highly regarded Orewa College, with the popular Te Ara Tahuna Estuary Walkway just moments away for sunny weekend strolls and bike rides along the water.\r\n\r\nProperties offering this combination of sun-filled outdoor living, pool side entertaining, dual access parking, and an unbeatable Red Beach location do not last long.",
